   $q$Listen. Ana writes a letter to Grandpa, who lives far away. Ana folds the letter, puts it in an envelope, and writes Grandpa's address on the front. Next, Ana sticks a stamp in the corner. Then Ana drops the letter into a blue mailbox, and mail workers sort it and carry it across the country. A few days later, Grandpa opens the letter and smiles. What does Ana do right after putting on the stamp? Tap the answer.$q$, $q$[{"text":"mails it","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"mails it"}},{"text":"writes it","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"writes it"}},{"text":"folds it","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"folds it"}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$mails it$q$, $q$Ana wrote and folded the letter first. After the stamp, Ana mailed it by dropping it into the mailbox.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
