   $q$Listen. Max and Grandpa were camping in a tent in the woods. The stars were out, and the woods were dark. In the middle of the night, something outside went crunch, crunch. Max sat up straight, shaking. "Grandpa, what is that noise?" Max whispered. Grandpa peeked out with a flashlight. It was only a little fox, looking for snacks. Max giggled, and Grandpa gave Max a hug. How would Max say, what is that noise? Tap the picture.$q$, $q$[{"text":"scared","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"face_scared","count":1}},{"text":"grumpy","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"face_mad","count":1}},{"text":"happy","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"face_happy","count":1}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$scared$q$, $q$Max was shaking and whispered in the dark. Max felt scared, so those words should sound scared and quiet. Max giggled later, after seeing the little fox.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
