  ('4b75089b-d8ca-5c5c-bc1f-e54a7409b6e7', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g2-theme-summary'), null, 'medium',
   $q$Listen. Little Fox found a green pear on a tree and wanted to eat it right away. Grandpa Fox said, Wait a few days until it turns yellow. Fox took a bite anyway, and it was hard and sour. Fox made a face and waited. A week later, the pear was yellow and soft, and it tasted as sweet as honey. What is the lesson of this story? Tap the answer.$q$, $q$[{"text":"Be patient","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Be patient"}},{"text":"Tell the truth","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Tell the truth"}},{"text":"Work as a team","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Work as a team"}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Be patient$q$, $q$The green pear was sour when Fox would not wait. After a week of waiting, the pear was sweet. The lesson is be patient.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
