   $q$Listen. One night, Frog looked into the pond and thought the moon had fallen into the water. Frog called Duck, and Duck called Fish, and they all tried to scoop the moon out. Then a big cloud floated across the sky, and the moon in the pond went dark. The friends looked up and laughed, because the moon was in the sky all along. What made the moon in the pond go dark? Tap the picture.$q$, $q$[{"text":"cloud","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"cloud","count":1}},{"text":"duck","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"duck","count":1}},{"text":"fish","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"fish","count":1}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$cloud$q$, $q$A cloud floated across the sky and covered the moon, so the moon in the pond went dark. The friends saw the moon was in the sky all along.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
