  ('dc465e20-1173-5eb6-b107-8c932bf077bf', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g2-theme-summary'), null, 'medium',
   $q$Listen. Long ago, the sky stayed dark one morning, because the sun would not wake up. Lion roared loudly, but the sun stayed asleep. Elephant trumpeted, but the sun did not move. Then a little bird on a branch sang a sweet, soft song. The sun slowly opened its eyes and peeked over the mountain, and from that day on, birds have sung every morning. Who woke up the sun? Tap the picture.$q$, $q$[{"text":"elephant","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"elephant","count":1}},{"text":"lion","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"lion","count":1}},{"text":"bird","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"bird","count":1}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$bird$q$, $q$Lion roared and Elephant trumpeted, but the sun stayed asleep. The little bird sang a soft song, and the sun came up. The bird woke the sun.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
