  ('e150cab3-e54a-506b-af12-1384eea3a8e5', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g2-theme-summary'), null, 'medium',
   $q$Listen. Every morning, Sami found one brown egg in the hen house. One week, the hen did not lay any eggs at all. Sami gave the hen fresh corn to eat, clean water, and a soft new nest. Soon the hen was clucking happily and scratching in the dirt again. The next morning, Sami found two eggs waiting in the nest! What did Sami give the hen to eat? Tap the picture.$q$, $q$[{"text":"bread","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"bread","count":1}},{"text":"corn","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"corn","count":1}},{"text":"cheese","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"cheese","count":1}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$corn$q$, $q$Sami gave the hen fresh corn, clean water, and a new nest. Then the hen laid two eggs.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
